      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_Hanover_Township%2C_New_Jersey"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Troy Meadows, within East Hanover, earned National Natural Landmark status and is a New Jersey Department of Environmental Protection priority site.",
